! NX WebUI 菜单
VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

BEFORE UG_HELP
  CASCADE_BUTTON NXWEBUI_MENU
  LABEL WebUI
END_OF_BEFORE

AFTER UG_MODELING_GROUP_FEATURE
  BUTTON NXWEBUI_PROJECT_INIT
END_OF_AFTER

MENU NXWEBUI_MENU
  BUTTON NXWEBUI_PROJECT_INIT
  BUTTON NXWEBUI_CMD_SEARCH
  BUTTON NXWEBUI_RADIAL
  BUTTON NXWEBUI_RADIAL_SLOTS
END_OF_MENU
